window.products.push({"id":575139,"name":"SEDGE Chef's Knife - 8\" Japanese Forged AUS-10 Damascus 67-layers Steel - Hammered STORM-X Finish - Ergonomic Pakkawood Handle - Professional Ultra-DE","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WoxiH8YVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【THE WINNING PROFESSIONAL CHEF KNIFE】- This 8-inch 56MM Deep Knife has a traditional Japan blade and handle shape - likened to the Gyutou. The Blade is very hard at 61 Rockwell and is Liquid Nitrogen Cooled Improving even further the Stain and Rust Resistance properties! Painstakingly honed by the expert craftsman using with the traditional 3-step Honbazuke method, the extremely sharp scalpel-like edge is hand finished at 8-12° per side Ensuring Incredible Sharpness & Safety with Effortless S 【PREMIUM JAPANESE AUS-10 STEEL DEEP BLADE】 -An ultra Janpanese AUS-10 67-Layers Damascus High Carbon Super Stainless Steel ensures exceptional strength, durability and stain resistance. Extraordinary performance and edge retention. Under the vacuum heat treatment, ultra sharp AUS-10 Japanese super steel cutting core reaches 61+ Rockwell Hardness. It keeps a high level of rust-resistance, wear-resistance, and long-lasting performance while providing a maximum sharpness. 【ERGONOMIC PAKKAWOOD HANDLE】 - The handle is made from Ultra-premium Pakkawood, which is a material that known for its comfort, strength, andmilitary grade with life-long durability. The ergonomic shape with is engineered for superior hand control, extreme comfort and perfect blance. Ergonomic designed handle can minimize any fatigue, finger numbness or aches after holding the knife for a long time and offering graceful beauty and impeccable performance. 【MASTERFULLY ELEGANT PATTERN】- Mirrored STORM-X Finish! Gorgeously laminated and hot-forged, the ‘LiquidMetal’ pattern on the blade minimizes drag and stuck on food while maximizing your slicing efficiency, allowing you to glide through prep. Experience superior balance and control as you prepare your food, that's so razor sharp, it cuts through the vegetables and fruit like butter. 【SEDGE LIFETIME GUARANTEE】 - 100% SATISFACTION OR MONEY BACK GUARANTEE, try it risk-free. We guarantee a superior product that will give you a lifetime of exemplary service. With the luxury case, it is also the wise choice as a gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WoxiH8YVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SEDGE","source_asin":"B07G385CJL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-575139","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07G385CJL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07G385CJL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
