window.products.push({"id":575164,"name":"NIUXX Floating Shelves Wall Mounted, 2 Pcs Solid Bamboo Wall Hanging Rack Holder, 17\" Wall Storage Shelves for Bedroom, Living Room, Bathroom, Kitchen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BifJQ2sNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Solid Bamboo Wall Shelves] Constructed of organic bamboo, safe and durable, designed with a bar on 2 sides to protect your items from falling. The hollow design of the floating shelf also helps to prevent items from falling off or sliding forward. [Functional Display Shelf] An economical option to revamp your room style and also maximize the space, 16.9 Inches wall rack can be used for storing and displaying your collectibles, photos, and small items, fit for any home design. [Endless Shelving Possibilities] Group the easy-to-install floating shelves together or hang them separately to display books, photos, or plants in the living room, hold beauty products in the bathroom, or organize spices and jars in the kitchen. [Easy to Install] The package includes 2 bamboo shelves, 20 screws, 2 bamboo stick, 4 triangle brackets, and 1 instruction sheet. The shelves for the wall have pre-drilled holes and are easy to install after following the instruction and using the necessary accessories. [Unique Gift Choice] Not only wall shelf for display your photos, art craft, toys but also kitchen spices shelf and towel shelf for bathroom. An ideal present for housewarming, weddings, Christmas, Mother's Day, Father's Day. Please choose us when you want to send a gift to your friends and parents.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BifJQ2sNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NIUXX","source_asin":"B09TB9CCHX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-575164","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TB9CCHX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TB9CCHX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":575165,"name":"Melange 6-Piece 100% Melamine Bowl Set (Clay Collection) | Shatter-Proof and Chip-Resistant Melamine Bowls | Color: Light Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71N5sRic9FL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"\"Experience the Difference of an Authentic Melamine Dinner Set Upgrade your dinnerware set with one that blends superior durability, hassle-free maintenance, and rustic charm. Made using heavy weight melamine, these dinner plate and bowls are virtually unbreakable, keeps chips and cracks at bay, and can actually be cleaned in the dishwasher. Introduce some quirk to your dinner table with a beautiful melamine dinnerware set that doesn’t cut corners. - Heavy duty feel and break-resistant design. - Comes in multiple pack options at a price you’ll love. - Assorted colors - Dishwasher safe and 100% BPA-free. - Great for camping, RVs and outdoor use. Extra Dose of Durability Not all melamine dinner sets are created equal. Most come with a melamine content of between 30-60% that makes them weak, prone to cracks, and easy to shatter. But we’ve taken the premium approach and used higher percentage of melamine to create dinner plates and bowls that beautifully weather the rigors of everyday use Great for Outdoors No need for paper plates. Whether you’re going out camping, having an outdoor soiree, or setting off in your RV or trailer, our melamine plates and bowls complement it all with a touch of durability. Tough and hardy, this dinnerware set introduces a sense of normalcy to outdoor dining without any of the fragility. Maintenance Made Easy Get yourself melamine plates and bowls that you can actually clean in the dishwasher. While others break or crack while placed in there, our fully melamine dinner set can be safely cleaned without chipping the plates or ruining the design. Dine in Style Quirky yet cute, vintage yet modern, this colorful melamine dinnerware infuses any setting with a charm that never quits. The plates and bowls come in multiple colors and design options and are crowned by beautiful asymmetry. About Mélange Mélange dinnerware is all about treating you to everyday elegance. We believe fine dinner sets shouldn’t mean fragile dinner sets. We believe every meal should be complemented by dinnerware that makes you smile. That’s why we’ve used premium materials to bring on the durability, special craftsmanship to enhance the longevity, and lovely detailing to catch anyone’s eye. \"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71N5sRic9FL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Melange","source_asin":"B07GNPYMR2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-575165","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GNPYMR2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GNPYMR2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
