window.products.push({"id":575167,"name":"Banneton Proofing Basket Artisan Bread - PROSSMART Set of 3 Dough Rising Handmade Rattan Bowl with Linen Cloth Bread Lame 5 Blades Dough Scraper Brush","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Q1FPHcPLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥖 THE ESSENTIAL TOOLS FOR ANY BAKER AT YOUR CHOICE- Whether an enthusiastic beginner or a seasoned professional baker, a durable and reliable banneton proofing basket is a vital tool for ensuring your loaf turns out perfectly; Just dust the basket with flour, put your kneaded dough in, and watch it rise. We offer you multiple choices as this set includes most popular sizes: 8 inch basket for 1lbs dough, 9 inch basket for 1.5 lbs dough and 10 inch basket for 2 lbs dough. 🍞 SMOOTH SURFACE - Our handmade dough rising bowls are made of reliable selected A grade Indonesian durable rattan cane, guaranteed to withstand the test of time; The material allows the bread dough to stay warm, absorb moisture and regulates fermentation optimally for a nice texture and a crispy crust. 🍞 LIGHTWEIGHT AND BEAUTIFULLY HANDCRAFTED - Carefully crafted, the dough will easily obtain a lovely artisan swirl design, as well as slipping out smoothly onto baking surface. 🍞 WASHABLE LINEN CLOTH INCLUDED - If you are working with a high hydration dough, it may spread out due to the increased moisture content; As an alternative, you can place the dough in the cloth lined proofing basket; The dough will hold its place and shape properly. 🥖 PREMIUM QUALITY - This set contains premium quality bread making tools: 3 premium banneton proofing baskets 8 inch, 9 inch and 10 inch, 3 flax linen cloth, 1 bread scoring lame with wooden handle and stainless steel arm, including 5 extra blades, 1 dough scrapper and 1 handy brush, adapted to work within the round banneton baskets. 🧹 EASY TO CLEAN- Once the loaf is removed, brush the inside of the basket with the clean brush and allow to air dry. 🎁 PERFECT GIFT IDEA - This set is a reliable gift for the baking enthusiasts who wants to take their bread making skills to the next level; Any housewife can make delicious artisan bread and cookies for their little children and have fun baking with the family. 👩👧👦HAVE FUN MAKING BREAD WITH YOUR FAMILY! - Now you can make three loaves at a time with our set of three proofing bowls - 8 inch, 9 inch, 10 inch - ideal for small to large round loaves. Bread experience can be enjoyed in your own home kitchen and you can create wonderful memories with your loved ones. 💲 100% MONEY BACK GUARANTEE - If you are not fully satisfied with your purchase, you can return your items and we will refund your money in full; Our customer service will do their best to assist with your questions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Q1FPHcPLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PROSSMART","source_asin":"B07ZX4GJTP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-575167","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZX4GJTP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZX4GJTP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
