window.products.push({"id":575183,"name":"Rovtop 12\" High Velocity Floor Fan, Rechargeable Outdoor Indoor Fan, 15000 mAH Cordless Portable Battery Operated Fan Run for 4.5-18 Hours, 360° Adjus","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.77,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71t-3+uJiIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【With battery and rechargeable】 Rovtop 12-inch rechargeable outdoor fan has a 15000mAh large lithium-ion battery, and it takes 2.5 to 3 hours to fully charge. It can run for 4.5 to 18 hours, enough to support a day's cooling. In addition, with a USB interface, you can charge digital devices. 【High-speed fan with tilt function】 The battery fan has an adjustable 360° tilt head, allowing you to guide high-speed air up, down, left, and right to cool or ventilate the fan in a certain area. In addition, the fan blade design combined with a powerful brushless DC motor can provide a maximum of 3500 CFM of high-performance airflow and long-lasting functions. It can move a lot of air and is very suitable for use in garages, warehouses, indoors, workshops, gyms and outdoors. 【Variable speed control and LED battery indicator】 This battery-powered fan has a variable speed setting that allows you to control the airflow and meet your needs. At the same time, this high-speed fan is designed to run quietly and efficiently, so it won’t Disturb users during work or breaks. There is an LED battery life indicator on the control box, which can indicate the battery life, help you adjust the battery life according to your needs, and avoid any annoying accidents. 【Ideal for outdoor use】 This rechargeable fan is equipped with LED lighting, which can ensure that it can work while lighting at night or in a dark environment. Equipped with a plastic frame, fan blades and non-slip rubber feet, it is more in line with industrial fan specifications. This fan has the ability to withstand the impact of falling, is not easy to rust, and can operate normally in various environments, providing you with a reliable and convenient outdoor cooling solution. 【Simple assembly without tools】 The industrial fan has a scientific appearance design and a more reasonable structure, with four ways of use: handle, hanging hook, floor-standing structure, and nailing to the wall, which can be used according to the actual environment. You can assemble the fan immediately, just follow the instructions on the outer box to assemble the fan and the fan frame together, and you're done.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71t-3+uJiIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rovtop","source_asin":"B0C4GQ2QSL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-575183","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4GQ2QSL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4GQ2QSL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
