window.products.push({"id":575252,"name":"Tredy 2-Cup Coffee Maker, One Touch Automatic Drip Coffee Machine with Removable Water Reservoir, Glass Carafe, Automatic Shut Off & Warm Plate for Ho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617-rSUFQBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ease of Use: Brew a cup of coffee simply by one-touch offers ease of use without a great deal of control over variables that will influence the brew, ensures flavour of coffee,  they'll heat the water and brew the coffee in a very hands-off manner. If you’re looking for a no-frills machine that’s straight forward and consistent. Portable Size : Mini sized coffee brewer is ideal for a dorm room or small kitchen with its small footprint. It brews a full pot (four cups maximum) more quickly than larger-capacity devices, This stunning coffee maker has a modern design that will stand out on any countertop. Easy to Clean: This coffee maker comes with a glass carafe, which is lightweight and easy to clean thanks to wide openings and being dishwasher safe. And the removable water reservoir make it use to refill and clean. Heating Plate &Automatic Shut Off: After brewing, the hot plate automatically activates to keep your carafe of precious bean juice warm. Then 20mins later, it shuts off, a handy safety feature to avoid burning the carafe dry. Reusable Filer: The Brewer comes with a permanent filter, which is a more eco-friendly option. In addition, opting for a reusable filter means that’s one less item to remember to toss into your grocery cart on a regular basis.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617-rSUFQBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TREDY","source_asin":"B09YLPYMKD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-575252","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YLPYMKD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YLPYMKD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":575253,"name":"Bart Forbes Hand Signed Golf Art Print The Golfer & Lady Golfer Couple Vintage Prints","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sGTQ0lZwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These great prints have been stored for years. These are two of Bart Forbes most famous, classic, images. These prints taken from his oil on canvas paintings. These need to be framed, displayed, and enjoyed. They both measure 17 1/4\" x 35\" including the white border. The image size is 11 1/4\" x 28\". The first picture was taken with a flash, the others without. You can see the signatures from the painting, reproduced in the lower left corner, then his HAND SIGNED signature in the right. You'll see a pair occasionally up for sale, but these are starting to be in short supply. While there are plenty of the Lady Golfer prints out there, it's rare to find a hand signed one. And The Golfer print is getting hard to find also. Here's a chance to get them BOTH HAND SIGNED. About the artist: Bart Forbes is one of America’s preeminent artists and illustrators. He has worked for popular magazines including TIME, Sports Illustrated, Ladies Home Journal, McCalls, Golf Digest, as well as a broad selection of corporate clients. His distinctive style has been highly sought. Among his highest honors were 1986 Sport Artist of the Year given by the American Sport Art Museum and Archives, and selection as Official Artist for the 1988 Olympics. His work spans a wide range of topics, but he is best known for his sports illustrations. He has designed over 20 commemorative stamps for the U.S. Postal Service. Other sporting events he has illustrated and designed posters for include the Boston Marathon, PGA and Senior’s tournaments, The Americas Cup, the Indianapolis 500 and 1992 and 1996 Olympic Games. In addition to his many sports theme paintings and posters, Forbes has also produced a number of beautiful series based on his studies of endangered species, history, and music.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sGTQ0lZwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bart Forbes","source_asin":"B07KDZJ9KJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-575253","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KDZJ9KJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KDZJ9KJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":575254,"name":"SPLF 6 Pack Dishwasher Safe Reusable Gallon Freezer Bags, BPA FREE Extra Thick Reusable Storage Bags Leakproof Silicone and Plastic Free for Marinate ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71p6HKd+VrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【FOOD GRADE MATERIAL】 Choose SPLF brand for TRULY food-grade reusable storage bags. Made of food-grade PEVA material that is PVC, BPA, Chloride and Lead free. Healthy and safe for family and earth. 【LEAKPROOF & EASY SEAL】 Upgraded double zipper locked closures ensure an airtight leakproof seal, perfect for storing and preserving food. With upgraded widened side and non-slip zipper design, you can easily open and close the snack bags. 【FREEZER SAFE & DISHWASHER SAFE】 The freezer bags can lock out freezer burn while keeping food fresh and full of taste, perfect for freezing meat, chicken, fish, fruits and vegetable. Upgraded PEVA material that is dishwasher safe under 60℃/140℉. We suggest alternating hand wash in water and air dry to clean for long-term usage. Not microwave friendly. 【LARGE & DURABLE】 Lunch bag size is 8.5\"x7.75\" larger than others (8.5\"x7.25\"), snack bag size is 8.5\"x5.25\" also larger than others (8.5\"x4.75\"). Perfect roomy space to hold more stuff. One extra thick reusable bag can save more than 300+ disposable baggies, perfect solution for plastic bags waste reduction. 【MULTI-PURPOSE & 100% SATISFACTION】 Perfect containers for food storage (lunch snack sandwich etc), home organize (cosmetics, jewelry, stationery etc), travel (make-up, travel toiletries, soap, creams etc), outdoor picnics. If you are not 100% satisfied with your reusable storage bags, feel free to contact us for solutions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71p6HKd+VrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SPLF","source_asin":"B0BTYV716X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-575254","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTYV716X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTYV716X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
