window.products.push({"id":575358,"name":"Mexican Glass Confetti Swirl Tumblers 16 Oz Set of 6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61G820D5yYL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"These glasses are hand crafted in Mexico from recycled glass, hence more bubbles from recycled glass, Mexican bubble glass. Multi colors of red, yellow, blue, green are swirled in the glass as it its blown. These glasses coordinate beautifully with the Colorful Confetti Swirl Mexican Pitcher. Because they are handmade dimensions and colors may vary slightly. Sturdy enough for everyday use. Mouth-blown lead-free glass. Dishwasher Safe Size: approximately 5 inches High and 3 inches Wide; and holds about 16 oz. to the rim. Care instructions: Our Mexican Glassware is individually mouth blown, hand formed and made from recycled glass. Trapped bubbles and slight variations in form, capacity and color are natural and charming features of the glassware. Although it is quite durable, this glass is not tempered so some extra care is necessary. A cooling-off period is essential after the glassware is removed from the dishwasher. Extreme temperature changes may cause thermal shock and cracking. This glassware is not suitable for serving hot beverages. Extra photos of glasses are to show variations in colors designs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61G820D5yYL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mexican Glasses","source_asin":"B00IH1LOYA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-575358","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IH1LOYA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IH1LOYA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
