window.products.push({"id":575461,"name":"Wild Girl: The Notebooks of Ned Giles, 1932 by Jim Fergus (First Edition Hardcover)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/912mh25XzlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"From Publishers Weekly Starred Review. Depicting the dusty Depression-era West this grandly, cinematically imagined sweat- and bloodstained saga, inspired by events that took place in Arizona and south of the border in the Sierra Madre badlands, dramatizes latter-day conflicts between whites and Native Americans. During the fall of 1999, an obscure, financially struggling photographer, Ned Giles—now in his early 80s—sells, for $30,000, La Niña Bronca, his only copy of a photo of a young Apache girl lying on the rude floor of a Mexican jail cell; the buyer's curiosity about the picture's provenance sparks Ned's memories. The rest of the book, set in 1932, reveals a legacy of heroism and lost love through Ned's scrupulously detailed diaries, which vividly recount a nightmare of harrowing misadventures beginning the day he signs on to be a part of the Great Apache Expedition, one of dozens of men hoping to free the son of a wealthy Mexican rancher kidnapped by the Apaches. (The wild Apache girl will be used as ransom.) The narrative unfolds as a series of flashbacks, intermingling short passages from the third-person POV of the fierce Apache girl and first-person excerpts from the diaries of the 17-year-old Chicagoan photographer on his first big assignment. Fergus (One Thousand White Women) makes unforgettable characters move against vivid landscapes in this laudable encore.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/912mh25XzlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Publisher","source_asin":"B001J9YC5U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-575461","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001J9YC5U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001J9YC5U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":575462,"name":"Rhovam Cooling Cup with Lid for Wine/Whisky/Beverages, 8.5 Oz Double Walled Silicone + Stainless Steel Freezable Drink Set of 1 (Green)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61asE5-f2tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【No Ice Cooling Technology】The cooling cup is able to keep your drink cold without ice so that it doesn't become bland, you can simply chill the cup in the fridge or freezer to keep your drink continuously refreshing and tasty. 【Safe Material】The inner wall of the cup is made of Food-Grade 304 18/8 stainless steel and the BPA-free outer wall is silicone, also the lid. Non-toxic and easy to clean, dishwasher safe. 【Doubled-Wall Open Design】Instead of reusing cooling gel, you can fill it repeatedly with clean water to avoid bringing in bacteria and bring you a healthier life. Enabling ice-free drink cooling. Also, Grooved textures on the outer wall makes the cup easy to hold, no worry it drops easily.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61asE5-f2tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rhovam","source_asin":"B0BWTF3PF9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-575462","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWTF3PF9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWTF3PF9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
