window.products.push({"id":575480,"name":"Clear Acetate Printed Boxes, fill with candy treats and favors - Party and Easter Supplies - 24 Pieces","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lzJ61HNHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Not all Easter party favors have to be egg-shaped! These clear boxes lend a layer of sophistication to your Easter party decorations - fill them with candy or small trinkets and place them at guests’ tables or distribute them at the end of the celebration. Each box features a pattern reminiscent of Easter egg decorations. Plastic. (2 dozen per unit) 3\" x 3\" x 3\" Simple assembly required.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lzJ61HNHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fun Express","source_asin":"B084Q63J5K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-575480","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084Q63J5K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084Q63J5K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":575481,"name":"9milelake Heat Roof Gutter De-Icing Ice Snow Melter Cable Tape Kit: On：6±3℃ Off：13±3℃ (80FT)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":98.19,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6178+EDbYgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description : On：6±3℃ Off：13±3℃  Prevent winter damage to the roof, gutters, and downspouts with a Roof Snow De-Icing Kit. The simple yet effective design features a low-profile, black cable that snakes along outdoor surfaces and provides an uninterrupted path for melting water to flow without re-icing and forming dams. Suitable for almost any inclined roof and approved for both metal and plastic gutters, the cable is easy to install with the included clips and spacers and provides a handy service year in and year out with no maintenance required. It provides 5 watts per foot and 120 VAC, and comes with a three-wire grounded plug and a 6-foot power cord. The cable is available in 30-, 60-, 80-, 100-, 120-, 160-, and 200-foot lengths to fit any sizing need; all mounting hardware is included.   From the Manufacturer   It's not those big icicles that do the real damage, it's the ice you don't see that backs up in gutters and under shingles. When the ice melts it can really do a number on repair costs. This de-icing cable prevents this water and ice damage by providing a clear path for melting water to flow off the roof. The versatile design adapts to most roof and gutter configurations. This product is intended for the sole use of preventing ice dams from forming on inclined roofs with tab shingles, in gutters and downspouts. This roof de-icing cable is not intended for use as a snow melting system to clear roof of ice and snow. This system can be installed with confidence that it will operate for years without requiring service. All components are made of the highest quality material and are tested during critical points in the manufacturing process.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6178+EDbYgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"9milelake","source_asin":"B079LK7NJP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-575481","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079LK7NJP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079LK7NJP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":575482,"name":"New 2021 Multifunctional 3 in 1 Stainless Steel Basin with Grater Kitchen Multipurpose Vegetable Dryer Cutter Slicer Fruits Washing Salad Maker Bowl S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YPuRRDupL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"★ New Upgrade - 3 in 1 Stainless steel Slicer,Latest Design with Unmatched Value. New 3pcs colander set includes 1 fine strainer, 1 basin and 1 julienne peeler.. A good helper for kitchen and used in most potatoes, cucumbers, carrots,cheese, and other vegetables and fruits. ★ High-Quality Materials - Bowl set and sieve are made of high-quality stainless steel, 3-in-1 grinder, stainless steel flakes, suitable for potatoes, thick material deepens large capacity, made of thick stainless steel, strong and durable, deepening 11cm large capacity,cucumbers, carrots, and other vegetables and fruits. Versatility Julienne Slicer - Perfect for making low carb and healthy veggie noodles&Pasta.Easily to slice the firm vegetables and fruits.It is also a Grater,Mandoline,Vegetable Chopper and Cutter.Simply helping you make professional-looking garnishes,like apple chips,onion rings,potato nests, elegant salads,vegetable pizza toppings,and more.Save you valuable time and money. ★ Excellent Design - Round edges that are easy to grip, allows you to grip better. Flat floor design for excellent stability. When not in use, you can stack the kitchen strainer and salad bowl to save more space. ★ Easy to Use and Clean - Any part of the vegetable chopper can be easily removed. The onion chopper is equipped with a cleaning brush for easy cleaning. It can be easily washed with water after use. This food chopper is easy to store and keeps the kitchen tidy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YPuRRDupL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fargin","source_asin":"B08HXDY2YK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-575482","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HXDY2YK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HXDY2YK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":575483,"name":"Umbra Conceal, Sturdy Metal Floating Bookshelf for Wall (Small), Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61skfOK0WAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Never have a boring wall in your house again — with this award winning floating shelf from Umbra, you can transform any wall, in any room, into a custom library for storing and displaying your favorite books. Introducing Conceal Bookshelf by Umbra The Conceal wall shelf is a floating bookcase that become invisible once stacked with books. Attach it to your wall (using the included mounting hardware) then slide the sturdy metal shelf between the back cover and pages of a book to create a base for additional books to be stacked upon. Once you’ve secured the back cover into the holding lips, place additional books on top until the sturdy metal shelf is hidden from view. Your books will appear to be floating on the wall! Alternate Use: In a bedroom, or other tiny space that is too small for bulky tables you can fasten Conceal to the wall and instantly create a small shelf to sit items upon - such as collectables or your cellphone. Details: Conceal Book Shelf (Small) measures 5 x 5 x 5 ½ inches and holds up to 15 lbs. Conceal Book Shelf (Large) measures 5 ½ x 7 x 6 ½ inches and holds up to 20 lbs. For a truly unique, space-saving small wall shelf order the Conceal small shelf for wall today! About Umbra: A global product design company providing original, modern, casual and functional design for the home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61skfOK0WAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Umbra","source_asin":"B07KQ3PNJC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-575483","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KQ3PNJC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KQ3PNJC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
