window.products.push({"id":575542,"name":"Abd El Kader by Cire Trudon Candle 9.5 oz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gI+DP5SuL._AC_SL1372_.jpg","description":"A gust of freedom blowing from the Mascara coast and the mountains picks up on its way the green scents of fresh mint, the rashness of fights, ginger’s hot and peppered air and the perfume of tea and tobacco from the Ouled Nail tribe.Born in 1808 near the town of Mascara in Algeria, Abd El Kader was a politician and military leader, as well as a writer, poet and philosopher who founded the Algerian state. Nicknamed “the friend of the French”, he was said to be enlightened and cultivated. A man who always fought with honor, he was highly respected even by his enemies.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gI+DP5SuL._AC_SL1372_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cire Trudon","source_asin":"B075TTGKDJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-575542","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075TTGKDJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075TTGKDJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":575543,"name":"24 PCS Artificial Glitter Holly Berry Stem Ornaments Berry Picks Branches Glittery Bead Sticks for Christmas Tree Decorations Wreath Vase and Home Dec","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yMNPmyuNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"24-Pack Package: This bundle comes with 24 pieces of stems in 1 package to provide sufficient ornaments for you to build your Christams tree quickly and decorate with more possibilities. Christmas Tree Decorations: This product will add a touch of glamour to your Christmas Tree. The glitter Artificial Berry Picks and the green of Christmas tree supplement each other, making the Christmas tree more noble and solemn. Material: These Christmas ornaments are covered with glitter powder. The decorative berries are made from foam, the main stem is made of iron wire wrapped with paper tape. There is no iron wire support inside the branches. The glitter on the surface is beautiful and safe. If there is some glitter dropping, it is a normal phenomenon. Perfect Occasion: This glitter picks branches are designed for Christmas tree ornaments and floral arrangement, holiday centerpieces, vase, New Year, wedding and home decor. You can also snip off individual berry branches and use them on smaller projects, like decorating gifts, wedding corsages or other DIY crafts. Originality: We designed and manufactured many Christmas decorations in different types, colors. This branch ornaments are well-matched with our Seasonal Décor Themes. These berry picks are suitable for you to DIY or make some handmade crafts, you can do these with your friends and family members, Just fully use your imagination, which can bring you a lot of fun and joy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yMNPmyuNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"5th LILY","source_asin":"B09ZQR9LX8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-575543","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZQR9LX8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZQR9LX8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":575544,"name":"Braun KF580 AromaDeluxe 10-Cup TimeControl Coffemaker, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41MS06JNEYL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description BRAUN KF580 - When it comes to coffee brewing technology, count on the tried and true build quality attention to detail Braun brings to every product. This flagship model of the AromaDeluxe fleet is completely digital and programmable, with an exclusively designed BRITA water filter. Easy pouring Filter release system for handling ease Pivoting filter basket with release button and overflow protection Take-out filter basket for easy filling Large, visible pilot light Water level indicator Easy cleaning Drip-stop / Pause & Serve feature Dishwasher safe carafe and carafe lid Dishwasher safe filter basket Integrated cord storage compartment Color - White Amazon.com Braun's premium AromaDeluxe takes a basic coffeemaker and adds some invaluable features. The coffeemaker brews up to 10 cups using a fast brewing method that thoroughly extracts the rich flavor and aroma from your ground coffee. The integrated Brita water filter also contributes to better-tasting coffee by screening out chlorine and other harsh minerals, plus it prevents calcification within the water tank. A marker on the top of the water tank helps you keep track of when the water filter needs to be changed. The AromaDeluxe's digital display has a clock and a brewing indicator that allows you to program the machine to brew your coffee before you get out of bed in the morning. Other handy extras on this coffeemaker include a permanent gold-tone filter; a filter release button, which swings the detachable filter basket open for filling or easy cleaning; and a Pause and Serve feature, which stops the brewing while you pour yourself a cup of coffee midway through a cycle. For safety, the glass carafe has a comfortable, nonslip handle with an open design to accommodate larger hands. This coffeemaker comes with one extra Brita water filter and is covered by a one-year limited warranty. --Cristina Vaamonde","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41MS06JNEYL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Braun","source_asin":"B000077XQN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-575544","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000077XQN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000077XQN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
