window.products.push({"id":575580,"name":"ZHENGLONG Abstract Art Horse Ceramic Statue Home Decoration Fashion Simple Suitable for Bedroom, Living Room, Office, Cabinet Decoration (Large, Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":46.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517WFl76AQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Creative inspiration: The combination of ancient ceramic techniques and modern craftsmanship creates the premium lightness of this ceramic horse statue, reflecting the balance of function and aesthetics in ZhengLong's artwork. The art of living. Modern. Simple. Personalized. Clean lines, simple style, comfortable forms and neutral colors make up this simple yet elegant family living room. ZhengLong ceramic sculptures are handcrafted and designed to provide a simple, elegant choice for your home décor. The abstract artistic shape is clean and crisp. And the color, with its elegance, is highlighting your distinctive high quality of life attitude. Exquisite craftsmanship. When making ceramics, you need to use a master with more than 10 years of experience to color the ceramics. When firing in the kiln, you have to go through a high temperature of 1380 degrees and 10 hours of firing, this process is called \"reduction fire\", also called \"reduction firing\", the impurities in the porcelain will be vaporized and removed, and when leaving the kiln, you have to go through 5 hours of continuous natural cooling. Applications: living room, bedroom, study, office, meditation room, yoga room, hotel, library, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517WFl76AQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZHENGLONG","source_asin":"B0BWWD9DS5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-575580","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWWD9DS5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWWD9DS5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
