window.products.push({"id":575590,"name":"Oriental Furniture Sisal Rug - Natural - 4' x 6'(B)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51wwjcs1ylL._AC_.jpg","description":"This Sisal Rug is economically friendly and perfect for high traffic areas. Sisal is a natural fiber that is derived from a cactus plant usually found in Brazil, Africa and Asia. Regular vacuuming is the best way to keep your sisal rug fresh.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51wwjcs1ylL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ORIENTAL Furniture","source_asin":"B001W75VBS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-575590","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001W75VBS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001W75VBS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":575591,"name":"Croscill Onyx Pole-Top Drapery Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91rQ9KpEGKS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Croscill's \"Onyx\" brings together rich golds and black in stripes, pleats, damask and patchworks to create a luxurious ensemble for your bedroom. The Onyx pole top drapes feature an all over gold and black damask on the body of the panels, while the coordinating tiebacks have a paisley stripe of the same tones, making for a nice contrast in prints. Each pole top drape includes two 41 inch wide by 84 inch long panels and two tiebacks. Each panel is fully lined with encased weights at each bottom corner for better draping. The top of each panel has a 3 inch header that is not included in the finished length of 84 inches, and a 3 1/4 inch rod pocket for use with a 2 1/2 inch continental rod or with many of the decorative rods that are out there today. These make a great way to dress up your window when hung alone, or pair them with the coordinating Onyx tailored valance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91rQ9KpEGKS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Croscill","source_asin":"B0015R2VOK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-575591","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0015R2VOK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0015R2VOK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":575592,"name":"Extremus Big Timber Insulated Lunch Bag, 30 Can (20L) Capacity, 7 Pockets Large Tactical Lunch Box, Leakproof, Easy Clean, 6~12Hours Hot and Cold Cool","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kAINwstyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄Up to 12 Hours of Insulation: This lunch bag contains 5 thermal layers to provide full-day insulation for your food and drinks. The lunch bag exterior is made of high-quality Oxford fabric, plus a layer of PVC coating, making the bag extremely durable and water-resistant. The non-toxic interior has 0.2mm PEVA, 210D-liner, and ultra-thick 6mm EPE foam to provide hot or cold insulation and cushioning. These five layers ensure your contents stay cold/warm/fresh for 6-12hours. ❄Leakproof Liner Technology: The soft, durable BPA-free PEVA liner is melded together with a special non-stitching technology that makes the main compartment completely leakproof and easy to wipe clean. And the bottom of the insulated lunch bag is covered with fully waterproof abrasion-resistant PU material, with four non-slip pads on the bottom that prevent your bag from getting damp or sliding around. ❄Fits 30 Cans + 7 Storage Pockets: This lunch box can store 30 cans of beverage with ice packs, or enough food for the whole family. The tactical lunch cooler’s exterior has 9 versatile storage compartments, including expandable and mesh zippered side pockets. The interior cooler’s top has a mesh zippered pocket for insulated storage. Also, the front zipper pocket contains a patriotic USA flag badge, stainless Carabiner clip, plus tactical MOLLE strap system for clipping on extra items. ❄Wide-Access Opening: The Extremus cooler bag features a wide-access top with double zippers and pull-strings for easy opening and closing. The Oxford fabric cushioned-handle on top and detachable adjustable shoulder strap with a non-slip thick shoulder padding allow you multiple carrying options. The large-capacity lunch bag dimensions are 11.81\" x 11.81\" x 8.27\", large enough to fit all your food items, but compact enough to carry anywhere. ❄Various Styles: The Extremus Big Timber lunch bag comes in two options: cooler lunch bag or cooler lunch bag with tactical MOLLE Water Bottle Pouch. The lunch bag has multiple color variations to fit your style and is a perfect insulated cooler for the office, park, beach, campground, boat, BBQ, or other outdoor activities.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kAINwstyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Extremus","source_asin":"B09X1HTYGD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-575592","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09X1HTYGD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09X1HTYGD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":575593,"name":"Kenmore Friendly Lightweight Bagless Compact Canister Vacuum, HEPA, Extended Telescoping Wand, Retractable Cord and 2 Cleaning Tools, Pet PowerMate + ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":269.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714UlreCPVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The lightweight Kenmore Bagless HEPA Canister Vacuum with Pet PowerMate is a multipurpose, all-floors design. Dirt, pesky pet hair, allergen-inducing dust and dander are no match for this powerful vac which cleans all surfaces from hardwood, laminate to pile carpet with ease. Kenmore bagged vacuums with the enhanced HEPA certified filtration system capture 99. 97% of debris, trapping dander, dust particles, odors, pollen and bacteria inside the vacuum, reducing the number of allergy-induced pollutants in the room. Your Kenmore vacuum is designed to tackle tasks with incredible power and ease. Accessories included are a crevice nozzle to clean hard-to-reach places, an upholstery brush for furniture, curtains, stairs, van and car seats, and a dusting brush for corners, baseboards and cabinets. All attachments are stored onboard the unit for easy access and storage. This lightweight handy small appliance includes a handle for flexible cleaning and easy transport, while smooth-rolling wheels maneuver easily around corners. Make housework less of a hassle, by investing in this well-made, reliable bagged canister vacuum from Kenmore. Compatible with Kenmore Canister HEPA Bags, 2-Pack, 02053291.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714UlreCPVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kenmore","source_asin":"B07T281NFK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-575593","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07T281NFK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07T281NFK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
