window.products.push({"id":575609,"name":"100% Natural Jumbo Hand Carved Coconut Candle Shell Holder Lantern Tealight Handmade Eco-Friendly Vegan Organic Non-Toxic Recycled Sustainable Boho Tr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Dd3sK8OnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NATURAL BOHO DESIGN: Beautiful & unique hand-carved coconuts available in 4 different patterns. Our coconut candle lantern is hand crafted from coconut shells with exquisite workmanship by Vietnamese artisans. Unique & a true one-of-a kind statement piece, this candle holder expresses special passion to the earth & artistic taste for any decor. These carved coconut shells add a coastal vibe or boho rustic charm to any indoor/outdoor space. Can be used for a tea light candle or as decoration. HAND-CRAFTED SUSTAINABLE ARTISAN PRODUCT: Connect with nature by bringing the outdoors in with this sustainable & 100% natural, organic Vietnamese handicraft. Beautifully designed and ethically made. Every item is handmade in ethical conditions and harmony with nature. Handcrafted by local skilled and dedicated artisans in Vietnam by hand and using traditional methods. Bring nature indoors where you can get a feel of the tropics or without leaving a carbon footprint straight to your home. GIVE THE UNIQUE GIFT OF NATURE: Your coconut candle holder will be delivered in a beautifully designed recycled gift box & packaging. Ready & easy to wrap for unique gift giving for unique meaningful gift. A perfect gift option for housewarming, college students, and families for holidays birthdays and more. Keep for yourself or give to friends and family who are eco-friendly or just love unique natural items for the home. YOUR PURCHASE MAKES AN IMPACT: Your purchase supports sustainability & helps the environment. Our decorative coconut shell candle holder is masterfully handcrafted by skilled artisans. By purchasing a maker-to-market product, you knowingly support Vietnamese artisan communities, help preserving indigenous crafts & cultures while promoting greater equity in World Trade. Not only are you supporting local artisans & farmers, but you are also contributing to a more sustainable future for our planet.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Dd3sK8OnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hollis and Hanh","source_asin":"B092NLFV4G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-575609","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092NLFV4G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092NLFV4G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":575610,"name":"M5 Corporation Italian Made Stainless Steel Fusti Container, 5-Liter/169-Ounce","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816wqEAv5gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These beautiful stainless steel Fustis are mainly used in Italy and throughout Europe as a convenient, attractive and cost effective means to store and refill water, milk, wine, oil, juice, sauces, syrups and honey to mention a few applications. Use of fusti in the kitchen provides the option of bulk purchases for many kitchen supplies. These fustis have a gasket and airtight screw lid and with convenient handles. A removable stainless steel spigot accurately dispenses the right amount of liquid and may be removed for easy cleaning. Cleaning simply requires washing with kitchen detergent and rinsing with cold water. The fustis offered here are made from the finest available Italian 18/10 stainless steel under the best possible quality controlled conditions. All joints are TIG(Tungsten Inert Gas) welded to insure completely smooth interior and exterior surfaces to prevent matter accumulation. These fustis are not the more common and less expensive \"folded\" metal containers that are constructed like tin cans, and have seams that can trap food particles, leading to bacterial contamination. National Sanitary Foundation (NSF) Certified.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816wqEAv5gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"M5 Corporation","source_asin":"B0088IL28U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-575610","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0088IL28U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0088IL28U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
