window.products.push({"id":575697,"name":"Scizorito Glass Teapot Stove Safe, Clear Teapot with Removable Filter, Infuser, Loose Leaf Teapot and Flowering Tea (Teapot: 33.8 oz)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NMB3TYNzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Premium Material]: With superb skills, our glassware is fired. These utensils are made under high temperature fire from 700 ℃ to 1000 ℃, using China's mature burning manufacturing process, we choose high-quality raw materials to create extraordinary quality, making it stovetop and microwave safe. Three capacity styles are enough for daily use or party service. All components of the glass teapot can be washed in the dishwasher, making tea hosting a breeze. [Natural Bamboo Steel Cover with Soft Seal]: The glass teapot is handcrafted from extra thick borosilicate glass and food grade 304 stainless steelComfortable ergonomic handle and smooth bamboo steel cover that 100% airtight and leakproof.So you serve teapot easily and boiling hot liquid won’t leak or spill while turning teapot. [Artistic Aperance]: The proportions and lines of the tea maker are carefully designed to make it look like a work of art. Ideal Tea Sets Tea Maker Gift for Women or your special person. [Safe & Easy to Use]: The Scizorito Glass Teapot boasts a minimal design and in a breeze to use. It can be used on your stove top or in your microwave, and it’s dishwasher safe, so it’s great for preparing tea and easy to clean up afterwards. To reheat your tea, simply place it over an open flame or on your electric hob, and it’s even suitable to leave in your fridge for creating a custom cold brew! [Best Gift for Tea Lover]: Maximum teapot capacity is 33.8/40.6/60.8 Ounce , you can make enough tea to greet guests on various occasions. This pretty clear teapot is a perfect gift for tea lovers making all kinds of tea and drinks like herbal tea, black tea, flower tea, fruit tea, lemonade, coffee, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NMB3TYNzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Scizorito","source_asin":"B09ZP9TD6R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-575697","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZP9TD6R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZP9TD6R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
