window.products.push({"id":575743,"name":"NUPTIO 2 Pcs Moroccan Style Candle Lantern - Small Sized Tealight Candle Holder with Transparent Glass Panels Great for Patio, Indoors/Outdoors, Event","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZSmmrvzvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The cobalt hues of this exotic metal candle lantern bring to mind images of mysterious Morocco! Candles are not included. Small size (7*7*16cm-2.63“ x 6.3\") lantern with transparent glass panels with large door opening. Uses tea-light, votive candles. Our lantern comes with a sturdy metal ring for easy hanging; also its flat base allow it sit on a flat surface - Suitable for hanging or use as a freestanding lamp. It is lightweight, and convenient to carry around. Works great with any wax candle or LED candles. Use it to create a romantic atmosphere for marriage proposal, wedding anniversary, bars, night clubs, parties, Diwali, Halloween, Thanksgiving, Christmas, Easter, etc. Not just candlelight—these lanterns add color, pattern and an exotic global vibe to your patio or porch.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZSmmrvzvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NUPTIO","source_asin":"B0BTY4NLGS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-575743","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTY4NLGS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTY4NLGS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":575744,"name":"Jameswish Shaggy Plush Duvet Cover Set Super Soft Fluffy Faux Fur Comforter Cover Set Luxury Fuzzy Bedding Set 3 Piece(1Duvet Cover+2Pillowcases) with","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":56.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516FCWu-HJL._AC_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM MATERIAL - The front of the faux fur duvet cover and pillowcase is made of 100-percent polyester microfiber plush shaggy fabric , and the back is ultra soft crystal velvet fabric. Resistance to fade,Wrinkles,pilling resistant. Add a touch of graceful color to your room. Also offers the best warmth and comfortable breathability. MULTI PURPOSE - In summer,this Pink Whiteombre duvet cover can be used as a bed blanket alone to provide you with enough comfort. In winter, just insert the quilt or comforter into the plush duvet cover, and you can easily embrace the warmth without fear of the cold. MEASUREMENTS & PACKAGE - Full: 1 x duvet cover 78\" x 90\", 2x pillowcases 20\" x 26\". Queen: 1 x duvet cover 90\" x 90\", 2 x pillowcases 20\" x 26\". King: 1 x duvet cover 90\" x 104\", 2 x pillowcases 20\"x 36\".The duvet is not included. ELEGANT LOOK & PERFECT GIFT - This fashionable, exquisite and dreamy Pink Whiteombre plush duvet cover set can bringing surprises to any room or sofa of yours. This gorgous fluffy duvet cover set is a great gift for everyone, every holiday and special occasion. MACHINE WASH & EASY CARE - Turn the plush side inside first to avoid damage. Machine wash in a gentle cycle or dry clean. Dry at low temperature or dry flat. Avoid hanging to dry, otherwise it will cause deformation. Don't bleach. Do not iron. We recommend washing before the first use because it will come off a bit when the product is cut and is more skin-friendly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516FCWu-HJL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jameswish","source_asin":"B0BTJ1F29M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-575744","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTJ1F29M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTJ1F29M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
