window.products.push({"id":575890,"name":"8x10 Feet Dark Gray Grey Charcoal Colors Soft Shag Shaggy Fluffy Fuzzy Furry Hand-Woven Decorative Designer Modern Contemporary Smooth Non-Skid Living","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":250.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1jmlzgqcNS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Congratulations! You have just chosen a high quality and aesthetically beautiful rug. Our luxurious rugs are made with the finest quality yarn possible and are designed by today's modern fashion experts with durability, modern artistic palette, comfort and affordability in mind. Each rug goes through a special preparation process that will produce durable and beautiful shag rugs. The rug yarn is first dyed to custom color specifications, and then are tufted individually by the hands of talented artisans. New stain and soil resistant advanced technology is then added to determine durability, quality and performance. Our rug collection strives to meet your sophisticated design taste and expression of style. We are so pleased to manufacture and provide a superior rug that is sure to bring sophistication, luxury and comfort to your living space. Enjoy your new rug. Gray canvas backing scratch resistant for your hardwood floor. Plush and very thick, luxurious 100% polyester soft buttery detailed fur. Made in U.S.A and imported. Vibrant colors heavy duty. Exquisite colors and sophisticated hand carved designs, of the finest viscose yarn. These bold, textural patterns are hand crafted of a fine blend of durable yarn for maximum longevity. Soft and luxurious, these rugs combine a multi-level pile and tonal colors that are sure to please.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1jmlzgqcNS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LA Rug Linens","source_asin":"B015TC0UY4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-575890","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B015TC0UY4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B015TC0UY4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
